9\\,\\,\\,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we have\n\n$$\n115-16=99.\n$$\n\nHowever, since our answer must be negative, we need to change the sign of the answer above. \n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n16-115=-99.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186064526 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186064256 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "f1c51da0-7569-50c0-b405-c74419d47ef3" :knowledge-point/title "Subtracting a Positive Number From a Non-Negative Number With Larger Numbers"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4fac70db-d065-51b6-9ca6-93465e345589" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-24" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186433287}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4fac70db-d065-51b6-9ca6-93465e345589" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-24" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186433287} :answer-field/id #uuid "156fe49c-9c2d-55e0-b505-14d092bff060" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186061386}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "b8f6a9f4-4f58-50a4-818d-d75ee08e55ed" :question/math-academy-id "q-170960" :question/problem "$12-36=${{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Since $36$ is larger than $12,$ the answer will be negative.\n\nWe start by solving an easier problem:\n\n$$\n36-12\n$$\n\nNext, we carry out the subtraction:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} &  & \\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\, \\\\  &  & \\,\\,\\,3\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,6\\,\\,\\, \\\\ \\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,\\,\\,\\, &  & \\,\\,\\,1\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,2\\,\\,\\, \\\\  &  & \\,\\,\\,2\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,4\\,\\,\\,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we have\n\n$$\n36-12=24.\n$$\n\nHowever, since our answer must be negative, we need to change the sign of the answer above. \n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n12-36=-24.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 