ut the subtraction:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} &  & \\,\\,\\,\\begin{aligned}\\,\\,2\\end{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\begin{aligned}\\,\\,10\\end{aligned} \\\\  &  & \\,\\,\\,3\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,0\\,\\,\\, \\\\ \\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,\\,\\,\\, &  &  & \\,\\,\\,5\\,\\,\\, \\\\  &  & \\,\\,\\,2\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,5\\,\\,\\,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we have\n\n$$\n30-5=25.\n$$\n\nHowever, since our answer must be negative, we need to change the sign of the answer above. \n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n5-30=-25.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186433317 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186064255 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "6a3c970b-4086-52ef-ac0f-2b8c3d72fd51" :knowledge-point/title "Subtracting a Positive Number From a Non-Negative Number"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "40ad7bdf-e8a7-52aa-a519-572de5b22e4d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186433286}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "40ad7bdf-e8a7-52aa-a519-572de5b22e4d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186433286} :answer-field/id #uuid "6f649466-3794-536a-ae6b-950069c24146" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186433309}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "486392b5-8044-5dbd-8a23-dd3a5b4a71e1" :question/math-academy-id "q-236758" :question/problem "$2-5=${{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "To subtract $5$ from $2$, we start at $2$ on the number line and move $5$ places to the left. \n\n![](images/c6/c63a3db44b79e751c7cf1a49dcebcbb1d00cea0427da4ef271d07646e4be2748.png)\n\nThis gives $2-5=-3.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186433319 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186064255 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "6a3c970b-408